<div id="landing" class="landing">
<section class="hero">
<div class="brand">♡✈ SKYCONNECTION<small>CABIN CREW COMMUNITY</small></div>
<h1>More Than<br>Just Dating.<i>It's a Lifestyle.</i></h1>
<p>A private community created for cabin crew — for dating, genuine friendships, gatherings, activities and the people who understand the lifestyle.</p>
<div class="features">
<div class="feature"><div class="fi">♡</div><div><b>Find Connections</b><span>Meet verified crew who are open to meaningful connections.</span></div></div>
<div class="feature"><div class="fi">♧</div><div><b>Make Friends</b><span>Build friendships with crew from around the world.</span></div></div>
<div class="feature"><div class="fi">◫</div><div><b>Gatherings & Events</b><span>Discover dinners, meet-ups and crew activities.</span></div></div>
<div class="feature"><div class="fi">✈</div><div><b>Share Experiences</b><span>Connect around destinations, hobbies and aviation life.</span></div></div>
</div><div class="wave"></div><div class="heroquote">“We don't just connect flights, we connect hearts.”</div>
</section>

<section class="authWrap">
<div class="auth">
<div class="authHead"><div><h2 class="title" id="authTitle">Create Your Account</h2><div class="sub" id="authSub">Join the exclusive cabin crew community</div></div><button class="switch" id="switchBtn">Log In</button></div>
<div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" id="signupTab">Sign Up</button><button class="tab" id="loginTab">Log In</button></div>

<div id="signupBox">
<div class="notice"><b>Verification Required</b>Upload a Facecard or Platinum Card with your staff number. Verification can take up to 48 hours.</div>
<div class="notice"><b>Verification Code</b>Authorized code can instantly bypass document verification. Never expose a real production code in client-side code.</div>
<form id="signupForm">
<h3>Account</h3><div class="grid two">
<label class="field">Email<input required type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@email.com"></label>
<label class="field">Password<input required type="password" name="password" minlength="6" placeholder="Minimum 6 characters"></label>
</div>
<h3>Personal Information</h3><div class="grid">
<label class="field">First Name<input required name="first" placeholder="First Name"></label>
<label class="field">Last Name<input required name="last" placeholder="Last Name"></label>
<label class="field">Date of Birth<input required type="date" name="dob"></label>
</div>
<div class="grid two" style="margin-top:9px">
<label class="field">Gender<select required name="gender"><option value="">Select</option><option>Woman</option><option>Man</option><option>Non-binary</option><option>Prefer not to say</option></select></label>
<label class="field">Nationality<select required name="nationality"><option value="">Select</option><option>UAE</option><option>UK</option><option>India</option><option>Philippines</option><option>Other</option></select></label>
</div>
<h3>Cabin Crew Information</h3><div class="grid">
<label class="field">Airline<select required name="airline"><option value="">Select Airline</option><option>Emirates</option><option>Etihad Airways</option><option>Qatar Airways</option><option>flydubai</option><option>Other</option></select></label>
<label class="field">Staff Number<input required name="staff" placeholder="Staff Number"></label>
<label class="field">Role<select required name="role"><option value="">Select</option><option>Cabin Crew</option><option>Senior Cabin Crew</option><option>Purser</option><option>Former Cabin Crew</option></select></label>
</div>
<h3>Verification <small>(one document)</small></h3>
<div class="uploads"><div class="upload"><b>▣ Facecard</b><small>Airline Facecard</small><input type="file" name="facecard" accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.pdf"></div><div class="upload"><b>▤ Platinum Card</b><small>Airline Platinum Card</small><input type="file" name="platinum" accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.pdf"></div></div>
<div class="code"><input id="verifyCode" placeholder="Enter authorized verification code"><div id="verifyStatus" class="verified">Verification pending</div></div>
<h3>Preferences</h3><div class="grid">
<label class="field">Looking For<select name="looking"><option>Women</option><option>Men</option><option>Everyone</option></select></label>
<label class="field">Age Range<select name="age"><option>18–25</option><option>26–35</option><option>36–45</option><option>46+</option></select></label>
<label class="field">Location<input name="location" placeholder="Dubai, London, Doha..."></label>
</div>
<div class="checks"><label><input type="checkbox" name="purpose" value="Dating"> Dating</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="purpose" value="Friendship"> Friendship</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="purpose" value="Gatherings"> Gatherings</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="purpose" value="Activities"> Activities</label></div>
<label style="font-size:10px"><input required type="checkbox" style="width:auto"> I agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.</label>
<button class="mainBtn">Create Account ♡</button><div id="signupMsg" class="msg"></div>
</form>
</div>

<div id="loginBox" class="loginBox hidden">
<div class="notice"><b>Welcome back</b>Log in to discover verified cabin crew, matches, messages, gatherings and activities.</div>
<form id="loginForm">
<label class="field">Email<input required id="loginEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@email.com"></label>
<label class="field" style="display:block;margin-top:12px">Password<input required id="loginPassword" type="password" placeholder="Your password"></label>
<button class="mainBtn">Log In</button><div id="loginMsg" class="msg"></div>
</form>
<div class="demo"><b>Demo accounts</b><br>alex@skyconnection.demo / demo123<br>sofia@skyconnection.demo / demo123<br><br>Admin prototype: admin@skyconnection.demo / admin123</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
